      "id": "CVE-2026-105846",
      "summary": "### Impact\nUnder certain conditions, an attacker can craft a redirect link that sends a guest user to an untrusted destination after authenticating.\n\n### Patches\nUsers should upgrade Payload packages to `>= 3.88.0` or `>= 4.0.0-canary.27`.\n\n### Workarounds\nUpgrading is recommended. Until then, remove user-controlled redirect values from authentication flows or restrict them to known local paths.",
